midhook 0x7100087cd0
#   mouse camera: 0x7100249780 after its 120 Hz tick (0x7100249960): w0 bit 0 = run the follow placement 0x71000783c0 this frame
midhook 0x7100249848
#   render resolution: the render thread's pass-state replay (0x71017b69e0) right before nvnCommandBufferSetViewports: viewports as floats at
